><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">Louis CHUANG</font></div></td><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;border-right:1pt solid #000080;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">BU-MIOT</font></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">Danny KEDAR</font></div></td><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;border-right:1pt solid #000080;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">COO</font></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">Nick TALUJA</font></div></td><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;border-right:1pt solid #000080;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">VP WW Sales &#38; Support</font></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000080;border-right:1pt solid #000080;padding:2px 1pt;text-align: